github.png, gitlab.png, jira.png and bitbucket.png are the Simple Icons paths
for GitHub, GitLab, Jira and Bitbucket, filled white and rasterized to 32x32
so the UI can tint them. Simple Icons are released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The logos themselves
remain trademarks of their owners.
